 following results:\n\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i = n\\overline x, \\qquad \\sum_{i=1}^n 1 = n\n$$\n\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nS_{xx} &= ∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i}^{2} - 2x^(―) \\cdot nx^(―) + x^(―)^{2} \\cdot n \\\\\n&= ∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i}^{2} - 2nx^(―)^{2} + nx^(―)^{2} \\\\\n&= ∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i}^{2} - nx^(―)^{2} \\\\\n&= ∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i}^{2} - n \\cdot (\\frac{1}{n}∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i})^{2} \\\\\n&= ∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i}^{2} - n \\cdot \\frac{1}{n^{2}} \\cdot (∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i})^{2} \\\\\n&= ∑_(i)x_{i}^{2} - \\frac{1}{n}(∑_(i = 1)^(n)x_{i})^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nas required.\n\nThe proofs for $S_{yy}$ and $S_{xy}$ are similar." 13194139535532 17592186045417 false] [17592186213005 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512877 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186213068 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512876 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221402 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512951 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221403 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512881 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221403 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512903 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221404 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512904 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221455 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512930 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186221456 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512900 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186229132 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512909 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186229132 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512943 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186229132 1038 #edb/ref 17592186512945 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186229683 1068 #edb/ref 17592186228279 13194139535532 17592186045417 false] [17592186229683 1068 #edb/ref 17592186228284 13194139535532 17592186045417 false] [17592186229683 1068 #edb/ref 17592186228289 13194139535532 17592186045417 false] [17592186229683 1068 #edb/ref 17592186228294 13194139535532 17592186045417 false] [17592186232372 1075 #edb/ref 17592186512277 13194139535532 17592186045417 true] [17592186232372 1078 #ed